### Faction war declaration - relations matrix button

faction-war-button = War

### Declare-war window (shown to the declaring leader)

faction-war-declare-title = Declaration of War
faction-war-declare-prompt = You are about to declare war on { $faction }. There is no taking this back.
faction-war-declare-allies-warning = Every faction sworn to you in Union is dragged into this war, and every faction sworn to { $faction } is dragged in against you. Their allies are not.
faction-war-declare-reason-label = Reason for war
faction-war-declare-reason-placeholder = State your grievance before the realm...
faction-war-declare-confirm = Declare War
faction-war-declare-cancel = Think Better Of It

### War declared pop-up (shown to every involved faction)

faction-war-window-title = War Is Declared
faction-war-declared-by-us = You have declared war on { $target }.
faction-war-declared-on-us = { $declarer } has declared war on you.
faction-war-ally-of-declarer = Your Union with { $declarer } binds you to their war. { $target } is now your enemy.
faction-war-ally-of-target = Your Union with { $target } binds you to their defence. { $declarer } is now your enemy.
faction-war-ally-of-both = You were sworn in Union to both { $declarer } and { $target }. Their war is now yours, and both are your enemies.
faction-war-reason-header = Reason given:
faction-war-no-reason = No reason was given.
faction-war-acknowledge = So be it
